# basePath FabricationIntro

::FirstMovement
{@PAL}  Press the Left Arrow on your keyboard (or click the button on screen) to move the wafer to the FURNACE station.


::FirstWaferGeneration
{@PAL}  Press Space on your keyboard (or click the button on screen) to generate a new wafer.


::ActivateFurnace
{@PAL}  Great. Now press the Space Bar to add the wafer to the FURANCE to apply an Oxide Layer.


::StunFurnace
{@PAL}  That's the wrong station. Find the FURNACE station.


// TODO: stun handling for non-furnace steps
::StunNonFurnace


::GateFurnace
@trigger    OnFabMicrogameCompleted
@when       microgame == "station:furnace"
$call       RequireMicrogamePrecision(0.9)


::FirstStationCompleted
{@PAL}  Your speed and accuracy are important!
wait 4
{@PAL}  Move to the next station. The panel shows the next station is SPIN COAT.


::ArriveAtSpinCoat
// TODO: ensure after completed first step
{@PAL}  Press Space to apply the photo resist in the SPIN COAT station.


::PoorAlignment
// show Poor Alignment panel and reset microgame